"Use File → Open to choose documents or folders, or drag files into Sumra. Browse Files and Open Recent find nearby and previously opened documents. Contents, thumbnails and bookmarks navigate the current document." = "使用“文件 → 打开”选择文档或文件夹，也可以将文件拖入 Sumra。“浏览文件”和“打开最近使用的文档”可查找同目录与曾经打开的文件。使用目录、缩略图和书签在当前文档内导航。";
"Use Navigation for page navigation, View for zoom, rotation and layout, and Edit → Find to search readable text. Match Case and Match Whole Word refine results. Scanned pages without a text layer need OCR before text search." = "“导航”菜单用于翻页，“视图”菜单用于缩放、旋转和布局，“编辑 → 查找”可搜索可读文本。使用“区分大小写”和“全词匹配”可缩小范围。没有文本层的扫描页需要先完成 OCR，才能进行文本搜索。";
"Bookmark This Position saves your place. Settings controls recent documents, saved reading positions, tabs and window restoration. Typography and CSS can apply to this document or become your defaults." = "“为当前位置添加书签”可保存阅读位置。“设置”管理最近文档、阅读位置记录、标签页与窗口恢复。排版和 CSS 可只应用于当前文档，也可设为默认值。";
"PDFs open with editing locked. Choose Enable Editing before filling forms or changing annotations. Lock Editing keeps unsaved changes and returns to reading. Tools → Annotations adds notes, text, shapes, highlights and attachments. Select an annotation to edit it. Tools → PDF Tools extracts, merges and exports pages, manages encryption and inspects signatures. Save preserves edits; Save a Copy writes a separate file. Applying redactions permanently removes marked content from the saved result." = "PDF 默认锁定编辑。填写表单或修改注释前，请点击“启用编辑”；“锁定编辑”会保留未保存的修改并返回阅读。“工具 → 注释”可添加便笺、文本、形状、高亮和附件，选择注释可进行编辑。“工具 → PDF 工具”提供页面提取、合并、导出、加密管理与签名检查。“保存”保留更改，“存储副本”写入另一个文件。应用删密会从保存的结果中永久移除标记内容。";
"Select text to copy, search or translate it. Ask AI uses an installed, signed-in CLI provider. Choose Selection / Current Passage or Entire Document, then Send. The chosen text is sent to that provider, which stores conversation history. Translate Selection sends only selected text." = "选中文本后可复制、搜索或翻译。“询问 AI”使用已安装并登录的 CLI 提供商。选择“选区／当前段落”或“整个文档”，再点击“发送”。选定范围的文本将发送给该提供商，会话历史由提供商保存。“翻译选区”仅发送选中文本。";
"Navigation → Read Aloud uses macOS voices. The playback controls choose voice and speed, pause or stop. View → Presentation uses full screen; B and W show black or white, L toggles the laser pointer, and Escape leaves presentation." = "“导航 → 朗读”使用 macOS 语音，可在播放控件中选择声音、调节速度、暂停或停止。“视图 → 演示”使用全屏模式；B 和 W 切换黑屏或白屏，L 切换激光笔，Escape 退出演示。";
"Settings provides appearance, reading, shortcuts, external commands and advanced JSON preferences. Keyboard Shortcuts lists current bindings, including your overrides. Blank shortcut fields disable a command's binding." = "“设置”包含外观、阅读、快捷键、外部命令和高级 JSON 偏好。“键盘快捷键”列出当前绑定，包括自定义值。快捷键字段留空可停用该命令的绑定。";
"Available actions depend on the document format and its permissions. Password-protected documents require their password. Image-only documents do not provide searchable text. Windows-only shell integrations are replaced by macOS file, print and sharing controls." = "可用操作取决于文档格式及其权限。受密码保护的文档需要输入密码。纯图像文档不提供可搜索的文本。Windows 专属的外壳集成由 macOS 文件、打印与共享控件替代。";
