"Creates an unencrypted PDF. Page content, external links, and outlines are retained. Annotations, forms, internal links, and document scripts are not merged." = "创建未加密的 PDF，保留页面内容、外部链接和目录。注释、表单、内部链接和文档脚本不会合并。";
"Creates a separate PDF. Page annotations and retained link destinations are preserved. Interactive forms, document scripts, and document structure are removed. Existing encryption is kept." = "另存为 PDF，保留页面注释和仍然有效的链接目标，移除交互表单、文档脚本和结构信息，沿用原有加密。";
"Creates a copy with annotations baked into page content. Form fields remain editable. Existing encryption is kept." = "创建副本，将注释合入页面内容。表单仍可填写，沿用原有加密。";
"Creates a copy with annotations and form fields baked into page content. They can no longer be edited separately. Existing encryption is kept." = "创建副本，将注释和表单合入页面内容，之后无法单独编辑，沿用原有加密。";
"Applies the current redaction marks to the output copy, permanently removing the covered content. The open document is unchanged. Existing encryption is kept." = "在输出副本中应用当前遮盖标记，永久移除覆盖区域的内容。保持打开的文档不变，沿用原有加密。";
"Creates a copy with the chosen passwords and the original permission settings." = "使用所选密码创建副本，保留原有权限设置。";
"Creates an unencrypted copy. The original file is unchanged." = "创建未加密的副本，原文件不变。";
"Creates a separate PDF with the current unsaved edits. Existing encryption and permission settings are kept." = "将当前未保存的修改另存为 PDF，保留原有加密和权限设置。";
"Creates a signed copy with the current unsaved edits. Existing signatures retain their original signed byte ranges. The open document is unchanged." = "将当前未保存的修改另存为签名副本，保留已有签名覆盖的原始数据，不改变当前文档。";
"Signature digests verify saved bytes. Current unsaved edits are not covered." = "签名摘要验证已保存的数据，不包含当前未保存的修改。";
